### Health Check
// 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### ── Customers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ###

### Create customer (with phone) → 201
// @name createCustomer
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Customers?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Test-Actor: {{adminActor}}

{
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+14155550100",
  "street": "123 Main St",
  "city": "Springfield",
  "state": "IL",
  "postalCode": "62701",
  "country": "US"
}

###

### Create customer (without phone) → 201
// @name createCustomerNoPhone
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Customers?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Test-Actor: {{adminActor}}

{
  "firstName": "Bob",
  "lastName": "Jones",
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": null,
  "street": "456 Oak Ave",
  "city": "Shelbyville",
  "state": "IL",
  "postalCode": "62565",
  "country": "US"
}

