### ── Orders ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ###

### Create draft order (empty line items) → 201
// @name createOrder
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Orders?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Test-Actor: {{customerAliceActor}}

{
  "customerId": "{{createCustomer.response.body.id}}",
  "lineItems": []
}

###

### Get order by ID → 200
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Orders/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/json
X-Test-Actor: {{customerAliceActor}}

###

### Add line item → 200
// @name addLineItem
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Orders/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}/line-items?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Test-Actor: {{customerAliceActor}}

{
  "productId": "{{createProduct.response.body.id}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### Remove line item → 200
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Orders/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}/line-items/{{addLineItem.response.body.lineItems[0].id}}?api-version={{apiVersion}}
X-Test-Actor: {{customerAliceActor}}

###

### Add line item again (for subsequent lifecycle steps) → 200
// @name addLineItem2
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Orders/{{createOrder.response.body.id}}/line-items?api-version={{apiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Test-Actor: {{customerAliceActor}}

{
  "productId": "{{createProduct.response.body.id}}",
  "quantity": 3
}

###

